' LEGEND
' ============================================================================

legend bottom left
    **Relationship Types**
    |= Symbol |= Meaning |
    | <|.. | Interface Implementation |
    | *-- | Composition (owns) |
    | o-- | Aggregation (manages) |
    | --> | Dependency/Usage |
    | ..> | Creates/Instantiates |

    **Design Patterns Used**
    • **Strategy Pattern**: ILogSink, ITelemetrySource
    • **Factory Pattern**: LogSinkFactory
    • **Builder Pattern**: LogManagerBuilder
    • **Policy-Based Design**: LogFormatter<Policy>
    • **RAII Pattern**: SafeFile, SafeSocket
    • **Template Programming**: RingBuffer<T>, LogFormatter<Policy>
end legend

